    Denis. Nikitenko, M. Wirth and K. Trudel, "Applicability Of White-Balancing Algorithms to Restoring Faded Colour Slides: An Empirical Evaluation.", Journal of Multimedia, vol. 3, no. 5, 2008.
    HK. Lam, OC. Au and CW. Wong, "Automatic white balancing using luminance component and standard deviation of RGB components", in Proc. ICASSP, 2004.
    E. Lam, "Combining gray world and retinex theory for automatic white balance in digital photography", in Proc. ISCE, 2005.
    A. Rizzi, C. Gatta and D. Marini, "A new algorithm for unsupervised global and local color correction.", Pattern Recognition Letters, vol. 24, no. 11, 2003.
    P. Getreuer, "Automatic Color Enhancement (ACE) and its Fast Implementation", Image Processing On Line, 2012. (FFT evaluation of ACE)
    G. Finlayson and E. Trezzi, "Shades of Gray and Colour Constancy", Color Imaging Conference, 2004.
    J. van de Weijer, T. Gevers and A. Gijsenij, "Edge-Based Color Constancy", IEEE Trans. Image Processing, vol. 16, no. 9, 2007.
    D. Cheng, D. K. Prasad and M. S. Brown, "Illuminant estimation for color constancy: why spatial-domain methods work and the role of the color distribution", JOSA A, vol. 31, no. 5, 2014.
    D. Jobson, Z. Rahman and G. Woodell, "A multiscale retinex for bridging the gap between color images and the human observation of scenes", IEEE Trans. Image Processing, vol. 6, no. 7, 1997.
    A. Petro, C. Sbert and J.-M. Morel, "Multiscale Retinex", Image Processing On Line, 2014.
    E. Provenzi, M. Fierro, A. Rizzi, L. De Carli, D. Gadia and D. Marini, "Random Spray Retinex", IEEE Trans. Image Processing, vol. 16, no. 1, 2007.
    E. Provenzi, C. Gatta, M. Fierro and A. Rizzi, "A Spatially Variant White-Patch and Gray-World Method for Color Image Enhancement Driven by Local Contrast", IEEE Trans. PAMI, vol. 30, no. 10, 2008.
    Y. Qian, J.-K. Kamarainen, J. Nikkanen and J. Matas, "On Finding Gray Pixels", CVPR, 2019.
    A. Gijsenij, T. Gevers and J. van de Weijer, "Improving Color Constancy by Photometric Edge Weighting", IEEE Trans. PAMI, vol. 34, no. 5, 2012.
